msgid "**传统微调** = 重新学说话（调整所有参数） **LoRA** = 只学「普通话和方言的差异」（只调整少量参数）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:343
msgid "比如："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:344
msgid "普通话：\"吃饭了吗？\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:345
msgid "方言：\"食咗饭未？\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:346
msgid "**差异**：发音不同，但语法结构相似"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:348
msgid "LoRA 就是只学习这些\"差异规则\"，而不是重新学习整个语言。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:350
msgid "**技术原理**（简化版）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:352
msgid "假设预训练模型的某个权重是 $W_0$（已经训练好的）。LoRA 不直接修改 $W_0$，而是学习一个\"调整量\"："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:354
msgid "W = W_0 + \\underbrace{BA}_{\\text{小的调整}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:356
msgid "其中 $B$ 和 $A$ 是两个小矩阵，它们的乘积 $BA$ 表示\"如何调整\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:358
msgid "**为什么这样有效？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:359
msgid "原来的 $W_0$ 有 $d \\times k$ 个参数（比如100万）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:360
msgid "$BA$ 只有 $(d \\times r) + (r \\times k)$ 个参数（比如1万，因为 $r$ 很小）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:361
msgid "**只训练1%的参数，达到相似的效果**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part3-model-transfer.md:363
msgid ""
"from peft import LoraConfig, get_peft_model\n"
"\n"
"# r=16 表示只学习16个\"调整方向\"\n"
"# 就像只学16条方言转换规则，而不是重新学所有词汇\n"
"config = LoraConfig(r=16, target_modules=[\"q_proj\", \"v_proj\"])\n"
"model = get_peft_model(base_model, config)\n"
msgstr ""

